OL,3,GNEWSAGrenade 'resembling elephant'
OL,4,Ablown up in field
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two grenade found in a
OL,7,Fstream has been destroyed in a
OL,8,Fcontrolled explosion by bomb disposals
OL,9,Fexperts.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police were called after
OL,12,Fthe device was found in the water near
OL,13,FDonnington Bridge, Oxford, shortly
OL,14,Fafter 13:15 BST on Sunday.
OL,16,FA photo of the grenade shared on social
OL,17,Fmedia by the force saw some comment
OL,18,Fthat it "resembled an elephant walking
OL,19,Foff".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
