OL,3,GNEWSAGrenade 'resembling elephant'
OL,4,Ablown up in field
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Explosive Ordnance Disposal (EOD)
OL,7,Fteam were called in to remove the
OL,8,Fgrenade. It was taken to fields just
OL,9,Fsouth of the bridge and and detonated
OL,10,Fwith an explosion heard about 17:00.
